<h3 id="bg-ill-08">Photographs, camera images and map tiles</h3>

Do not restyle a room photo, camera feed or map tile to look like an illustration. A diagram can explain a doorbell camera but never replaces its real image. [Photography](images-photography.html) owns photographs and camera images.

